%I A400777 #8 Oct 26 2026 17:39:42
%S A400777 138865817225,571633725203,1223123896032617
%N A400777 Nonsquarefree numbers k such that sigma(k) = phi(k) + tau(k)^10.
%C A400777 All squarefree numbers k such that sigma(k) = phi(k) + tau(k)^10 are terms of the sequence A399910.
%H A400777 S. I. Dimitrov, <a href="https://github.com/Stoyan16/Non-squarefree-numbers-k-such-that-sigma-k-phi-k-tau-k-10/blob/main/A400777">Python program</a> (GitHub)
%e A400777 138865817225 is a term since sigma(138865817225) = 172689859344 = 110772495120 + 12^10 = phi(138865817225) + tau(138865817225)^10.
%o A400777 (PARI) isok(k) = {my(f = factor(k)); !issquarefree(f) && sigma(f) - eulerphi(f) == numdiv(f)^10; } \\ _Amiram Eldar_, Oct 06 2026
%Y A400777 Cf. A000005, A000010, A000203, A013929, A399910, A399944, A399226, A400368, A400565, A400566.
%K A400777 nonn,hard,more,bref,new
%O A400777 1,1
%A A400777 _S. I. Dimitrov_, Oct 06 2026
